9
00:02:09,060 --> 00:02:13,497
I'm not going to be able to run away.

10
00:02:13,580 --> 00:02:15,756
I'm not going to be able to run away.

11
00:02:15,980 --> 00:02:17,568
I'm not going to be strong.

12
00:02:44,240 --> 00:02:47,060
