44
00:05:55,800 --> 00:05:59,997
I've been wanting to since the first
time I tried on floor five in Aincrad.

45
00:06:00,080 --> 00:06:02,897
I don't think I ever wanted anything more.

46
00:06:02,980 --> 00:06:07,320
You mean you hate Kirito so much that
you would cause all this suffering?

47
00:06:08,440 --> 00:06:09,377
Say what?

48
00:06:09,460 --> 00:06:12,237
A few of all people should
know better than that.

49
00:06:12,320 --> 00:06:14,555
I wouldn't go to all this trouble if I

50
