I'm freaking pissed I wasn't
the one that got to break him.

59
00:06:40,840 --> 00:06:43,660
But I'm gonna be the one
to snap him out of it.

60
00:06:43,900 --> 00:06:48,820
I'll kill whoever I have to and however
many I have to to make that happen

61
00:06:51,340 --> 00:06:52,240
You're sick?

62
00:06:52,740 --> 00:06:54,077
That's why you're doing this!

63
00:06:54,160 --> 00:06:55,980
You don't respect him.

64
00:06:56,120 --> 00:06:58,296
You just get off on making him suffer

65
00:06:58,800 --> 00:06:59,760
