76
00:07:35,820 --> 00:07:39,408
and from the Japanese players
the Chinese and Koreans killed.

77
00:07:39,520 --> 00:07:42,140
And soon as they're
done killing each other,

78
00:07:42,460 --> 00:07:45,401
