All you know is hate.

102
00:09:23,100 --> 00:09:25,397
I'll never give in to someone like you.

103
00:09:25,480 --> 00:09:28,320
I'll fight you, to the end!

104
00:09:55,780 --> 00:09:57,097
Oh,

105
