I'm the one, I'm the one
that should have died.

130
00:15:56,580 --> 00:15:57,410
Kirito.

131
00:16:01,560 --> 00:16:02,390
Kirito.

132
00:16:02,960 --> 00:16:03,790
Asuna.

133
00:16:04,080 --> 00:16:05,060
Kirito.

134
