141
00:16:30,720 --> 00:16:32,640
I'm sorry, Asuna.

142
00:16:33,380 --> 00:16:35,400
I'm sorry, Sinon.

143
00:16:36,140 --> 00:16:37,500
I'm sorry, Sugu.

144
00:16:39,780 --> 00:16:41,898
But I can't stand and fight anymore.

145
00:16:43,340 --> 00:16:44,360
I'm sorry.

146
00:16:47,840 --> 00:16:48,670
Damn it!

147
00:16:48,860 --> 00:16:50,820
