167
00:17:51,600 --> 00:17:52,430
Yeah.

168
00:17:55,540 --> 00:17:57,280
You're in here forever.

169
00:17:58,300 --> 00:18:02,180
Our hearts are what connect
us, so we're always with you.

170
00:18:02,600 --> 00:18:05,880
We're right here, no matter
how far apart we are.

171
00:18:06,740 --> 00:18:09,457
Always, even after our last goodbyes?

172
00:18:09,540 --> 00:18:13,497
Our memories and feelings,
they are what keep us together!

173
00:18:13,580 --> 00:18:14,800
Forever

174
00:18:17,820 --> 00:18:20,877
Is it okay, Yu-Gi-Oh? Can I...

175
00:18:20,960 --> 00:18:23,000
